<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!--
  Clipivo is distributed outside the Mac App Store (Developer ID) and is not sandboxed:
  posting the ⌘V keystroke for automatic paste requires Accessibility, which sandboxed
  apps cannot use. The hardened runtime is enabled at signing time. No extra entitlements
  are needed: there is no network server, no Apple Events and no JIT.
-->
